the Bee Cave Drilling difference?\"}],\"mediaCovers\":[],\"messagingHeadlines\":[\"High Quality Water Wells & Repair For The Texas Hill Country\",\"Our Well Services\",\"What Our Clients Are Saying!\",\"Join Our Newsletter\",\"Why Bee Cave Drilling?\"],\"testimonials\":[\"Thank you for expediting the replacement of our well pump. We sincerely appreciate your efforts and are extremely grateful we have water once again. It’s comforting knowing your team continues to provide quality work at a fair price. Michael M.\"],\"uniqueSellingPropositions\":[\"precision water drilling, utilizing state-of-the-art technology and years of experience to access pristine underground water sources\",\"designing, drilling, and maintaining public supply wells that meet rigorous health and environmental standards\",\"taking care of our customers\",\"their field and take great pride in their work\"]},\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-13T06:44:21.093Z\"},{\"brandingAndStyle\":{\"artStyle\":\"Balanced cool-toned palette, clean sans-serif typography (Inter), moderate use of photography.\",\"colors\":[\"#2299DD\",\"#898989\",\"#1F2937\",\"#2E2E2E\",\"#2E3084\",\"#00AEEF\"],\"fonts\":[\"Inter\",\"Abril Fatface\",\"Bebas Neue\",\"Fira Sans\"],\"logos\":[\"https://cw3prd.s3.us-west-1.amazonaws.com/2334180/account-logo.png\",\"https://cw3prd.s3.us-west-1.amazonaws.com/2334190/conversions/account-it-fav-favicon.png\"],\"writingStyle\":\"Clear, medium-length sentences; speaks directly to the reader (“you”); personal first-person voice (“we”). Avg 20 words per sentence.\"},\"companyName\":\"Account-it Consulting Services, LLC\",\"confidenceScore\":0.82,\"foundation\":{\"alternativeNames\":[\"Account-it Consulting Services, LLC -\",\"We respect the intellectual property of others and ask that you do too\",\"Agent CountingWorks, Inc\"],\"businessModel\":\"Appointment-Based Services\",\"businessModelConfidence\":0.95,\"companyRole\":\"Appointment-based provider\",\"industry\":\"Accounting & Tax\",\"industryConfid