:\"Parking at the Vista Ranch is ample & free! During busy times, please follow the signage to the back pasture when the front lot is full. It’s a short & beautiful walk to the buildings!\",\"question\":\"How about parking?\"},{\"answer\":\"Vista often hosts fun events such as music festivals, educational & community events, movies, and more! The best way to stay in the know if to sign up for our email list and follow us on social media. Check out the Event Calendar on our website.\",\"question\":\"How can I find out about events & happenings?\"}],\"mediaCovers\":[],\"messagingHeadlines\":[\"Visit Us\"],\"testimonials\":[],\"uniqueSellingPropositions\":[\"growing with integrity: low till, water conscious and focused on soil health\"]},\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-13T06:46:22.107Z\"}]"}
