\"Booking / appointment\",\"Phone call\"],\"idealPersona\":\"Local consumers in Texas who need abv and barrel aged and choose Vista Brewing for a trusted, food & beverage specialist they can rely on.\",\"industryGroupings\":[\"Food & Beverage\",\"Hospitality & Events\"],\"suppliers\":[],\"targetBuyers\":[\"Local consumers\"]},\"offerings\":[],\"onlinePresence\":{\"facebook\":\"https://www.facebook.com/vistabrewing\",\"instagram\":\"https://instagram.com/vistabrewing\",\"other\":{\"email\":\"howdy@vistabrewingtx.com, wholesale@vistabrewingtx.com, team@vistabrewingtx.com\",\"phone\":\"(512) 766-1842\"}},\"pagesScraped\":[\"https://www.vistabrewingtx.com/\",\"https://www.vistabrewingtx.com/about\",\"https://www.vistabrewingtx.com/beer\",\"https://www.vistabrewingtx.com/driftwood\",\"https://www.vistabrewingtx.com/team\"],\"positioning\":{\"foundingStory\":\"Co-Founders Karen and Kent Killough set their sights on building a destination where both locals and visitors can experience all the Texas Hill Country has to offer and fall in love with its rolling hills, beautiful trees & wildflowers and out-of-this-world sunsets. They created the Vista destination out of their mutual love for local craft culture, obsession with high quality and sustainably-produced food and drink, and passion for the beautiful Texas Hill Country.\",\"pitch\":\"Visit Vista Brewing in Driftwood, TX, a 21-acre destination with chef-driven food, award-winning craft beer, live music, and event spaces near Austin in the Texas Hill Country.\"},\"provenance\":{\"brandingAndStyle.artStyle\":\"derived\",\"brandingAndStyle.writingStyle\":\"derived\",\"foundation.businessModel\":\"derived\",\"foundation.companyRole\":\"derived\",\"foundation.industry\":\"derived\",\"marketAndCustomers.channels\":\"derived\",\"marketAndCustomers.customerNeeds\":\"mock-ai\",\"marketAndCustomers.funnels\":\"derived\",\"marketAndCustomers.idealPersona\":\"mock-ai\",\"marketAndCustomers.industryGroupings\":\"derived\",\"marketAndCustomers.targetBuyers\":\"derived\"},\"scrapedAt\":\"2026-10-13T06:46:22.107Z\",\"sourceUrl\":\"vistabrewingtx.com\",\"thinkBigger\":{\"certifications\":[],\"contentThemes\":[\"abv\",\"barrel aged\",\"beer\",\"hill country\",\"pour\",\"cans\",\"live music\",\"ale\"],\"faqs\":[{\"answer\":\"Yes! We welcome friendly dogs on leashes, and dogs are welcome inside the main Tasting Room & Restaurant.\",\"question\":\"Is Vista dog-friendly?\"},{\"answer\":\"Yes! Vista was built with families in mind. We have 21 acres of land to explore, including forts and lots of open space. There is a treehouse-style playscape, plus kid’s food & drink menus. There is a baby changing table in both the men’s and women’s restrooms.\",\"question\":\"Is Vista family-friendly?\"},{\"answer\":\"For groups of 15 or less seating is first come, first served. We do take bookings for large groups, and can host private parties up to hundreds of guests with our full-service private event department. Get in touch with our event managers via the web form.\",\"question\":\"Do I need to make a reservation?\"},{\"answer\":\"Yes! In addition to all Vista beer here at the brewery, we serve a curated list of Texas wines, many of whom we work with in our beer barrel aging program! We serve Texas cider and wine-based cocktails as well as non-alcoholic drinks.\",\"question\":\"Do you serve drinks other than beer?\"},{\"answer\":\"Vista has grown to be a known Hill Country music venue with top talent from Central Texas and beyond. We typically have live music Fridays and Sundays. Please see our event calendar for the latest schedule.\",\"question\":\"When do you have live music?\"},{\"answer\":\"Sorry, nope. Vista is a brewpub with a delicious food menu! We do allow outside celebration desserts with a $25 Dessert Fee, which includes plates, forks and napkins if needed.\",\"question\":\"Can I bring my own food?\"},{\"answer\":\"Yes! We offer guest WIFI.\",\"question\":\"Do you have WIFI?\"},{\"answer\":\"Parking at the Vista Ranch is ample & free! During busy times, please follow the signage to the back pasture when the front lot is full. It’s a short & beautiful walk to the buildings!\",\"question\":\"How about parking?\"},{\"answer\":\"Vista often hosts fun events such as music festivals, educational & community events, movies, and more! The best way to stay in the know if to sign up for our email list and follow us on social media. Check out the Event Calendar on our website.\",\"question\":\"How can I find out about events & happenings?\"}],\"mediaCovers\":[],\"messagingHeadlines\":[\"Visit Us\"],\"testimonials\":[],\"uniqueSellingPropositions\":[\"growing with integrity: low till, water conscious and focused on soil health\"]},\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-13T06:46:22.107Z\"},{\"brandingAndStyle\":{\"artStyle\":\"Balanced warm-toned palette with dark accents, clean sans-serif typography (acumin-pro), moderate use of photography.\",\"colors\":[\"#F7F8FB\",\"#2A1768\",\"#DA291C\",\"#ECEEF6\",\"#393939\",\"#3B5998\"],\"fonts\":[\"acumin-pro\",\"acumin-pro-condensed\",\"Northwest Round\",\"CoolKids\"],\"logos\":[\"https://cdn.rotorootercdn.com/images/images/graph-tags/rr_logo_square.png\",\"https://www.rotorooter.com/favicon.ico\",\"https://www.rotorooter.com/apple-touch-icon.png\"],\"writingStyle\":\"Clear, medium-length sentences. Avg 14 words per sentence.\"},\"companyName\":\"Roto-Rooter Plumbing & Water Cleanup\",\"confidenceScore\":0.73,\"foundation\":{\"alternativeNames\":[\"Roto-Rooter\",\"Roto-Rooter Plumbing\",\"Roto-Rooter Plumbing & Drain Service\",\"Roto-Rooter Plumbers\"],\"businessModel\":\"Local Service Business\",\"businessModelConfidence\":0.93,\"companyRole\":\"Local service provider\",\"industry\":\"Home Services\",\"industryConfidence\":0.93,\"mainAddress\":\"255 East 5th St, #2500, Cincinnati, OH 45202\",\"otherLocations\":[],\"overview\":\"Roto-Rooter Plumbing and Water Cleanup® service is the #1 plumbing and drain cleaning company. Open & Available 24/7. Call 1-800-768-6911!\",\"serviceLocations\":[],\"website\":\"https://www.rotorooter.com/\",\"yearFounded\":1935},\"id\":\"kb_1791873984643_q59w2gemn\",\"keyPeople\":[],\"marketAndCustomers\":{\"channels\":[\"Website\",\"Phone\",\"Facebook\",\"X / Twitter\",\"Linkedin\",\"Instagram\",\"Youtube\",\"Google Business Profile\"],\"ctas\":[\"Contact Us\",\"Schedule Service\",\"Download\",\"Schedule\",\"Call 800-768-6911\",\"Explore Our Videos\"],\"customerNeeds\":[\"Dependable help with minneapolis, mn\",\"Dependable help with select a state\",\"Fast, clear communication\",\"Confidence they're hiring a qualified, trustworthy business\"],\"funnels\":[\"Quote request\",\"Booking / appointment\",\"Contact form\",\"Phone call\"],\"idealPersona\":\"Local consumers who need minneapolis, mn and select a state and choose Roto-Rooter Plumbing & Water Cleanup for a trusted, home services specialist they can rely on.\",\"industryGroupings\":[\"Home Services\"],\"suppliers\":[],\"targetBuyers\":[\"Local consumers\"]},\"offerings\":[{\"category\":\"Product\",\"description\":\"Your Local Roto-Rooter Plumber in\",\"features\":[\"Schedule Service\",\"Locations\",\"Plumbing\",\"Drains\",\"Commercial\"],\"name\":\"Minneapolis, MN\"},{\"category\":\"Product\",\"description\":\"Get the Roto-Rooter App\",\"features\":[\"Schedule Service\",\"Locations\",\"Plumbing\",\"Drains\",\"Commercial\"],\"name\":\"Select a State\"},{\"category\":\"Product\",\"description\":\"Get the Roto-Rooter App\",\"features\":[\"Schedule Service\",\"Locations\",\"Plumbing\",\"Drains\",\"Commercial\"],\"name\":\"San Fernando, CA\"}],\"onlinePresence\":{\"facebook\":\"https://www.facebook.com/rotorooter\",\"instagram\":\"https://www.instagram.com/rotorooterplumbing/\",\"linkedin\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/roto-rooter\",\"other\":{\"phone\":\"(800) 768-6911, (612) 355-1657, (310) 728-4844\"},\"twitter\":\"https://x.com/rotorooter\",\"youtube\":\"https://www.youtube.com/user/RotoRooterTV\"},\"pagesScraped\":[\"https://www.rotorooter.com/\",\"https://www.rotorooter.com/about-us/\",\"https://www.rotorooter.com/products/\",\"https://www.rotorooter.com/locations/\",\"https://www.rotorooter.com/frequently-asked-questions/\"],\"positioning\":{\"foundingStory\":\"THE EXPERTS YOU'VE TRUSTED FOR OVER 90 YEARS Founded in 1935, Roto-Rooter is the largest provider of plumbing, drain cleaning and water cleanup services in North America. Roto-Rooter operates businesses in more than 100 company-owned branch and independent contractor territories and approximately 400 independent franchise operations, serving approximately 90% of the U.S. population and parts of Canada. Call today to schedule and appointment with our Pros! schedule online Call 800-768-6911\",\"pitch\":\"Roto-Rooter Plumbing and Water Cleanup® service is the #1 plumbing and drain cleaning company. Open & Available 24/7. Call 1-800-768-6911!\"},\"provenance\":{\"brandingAndStyle.artStyle\":\"derived\",\"brandingAndStyle.writingStyle\":\"derived\",\"foundation.businessModel\":\"derived\",\"foundation.companyRole\":\"derived\",\"foundation.industry\":\"derived\",\"marketAndCustomers.channels\":\"derived\",\"marketAndCustomers.customerNeeds\":\"mock-ai\",\"marketAndCustomers.funnels\":\"derived\",\"marketAndCustomers.idealPersona\":\"mock-ai\",\"marketAndCustomers.industryGroupings\":\"derived\",\"marketAndCustomers.targetBuyers\":\"derived\"},\"scrapedAt\":\"2026-10-13T06:46:24.643Z\",\"sourceUrl\":\"rotorooter.com\",\"thinkBigger\":{\"certifications\":[\"Water Damage LEAVE PLUMBING TO THE PROS BECAUSE WITH ROTO-ROOTER, YOU GET MORE THAN A GUARANTEE.\",\"Warranties Explore our industry-leading warranties that guarantee satisfaction and peace of mind for all your plumbing needs.\",\"Read More Jamie S LEAVE PLUMBING TO THE PROS BECAUSE WITH ROTO-ROOTER, YOU GET MORE THAN A GUARANTEE.\",\"LEAVE PLUMBING TO THE PROS BECAUSE WITH ROTO-ROOTER, YOU GET MORE THAN A GUARANTEE.\"],\"contentThemes\":[\"drain cleaning\",\"job done\",\"done right\",\"special financing\",\"highly trained\",\"trained professionals\",\"professionals since\",\"original experts\"],\"faqs\":[{\"answer\":\"We recommend an enzyme-type product, such as Roto-Rooter Pipe Shield®. The natural enzymes eat the grease and hair and keep the pipe from filling with sludge. Pipe Shield's exclusive formula uses natural bacteria to breakdown deposits, so it's safe for the environment. When used as directed each month, build-up can be prevented for up to 30 days.\",\"question\":\"What drain cleaning product could I use to get my drains flowing better?\"},{\"answer\":\"We recommend hiring a professional to apply RootX. However, you can do it yourself, but please read the instructions carefully before using. Flushing drain cleaning products down the toilet can cause additional problems if not done carefully. This product works best when applied through a sewer clean-out port with the water running.\",\"question\":\"Is RootX® something I can flush down my toilet or is that something Roto-Rooter or a professional should handle?\"}],\"mediaCovers\":[],\"messagingHeadlines\":[\"The Plumbing Experts You've Trusted for Over 90 Years\",\"OUR SERVICES\",\"LEAVE PLUMBING TO THE PROS\",\"YOU HAVE QUESTIONS, WE HAVE ANSWERS.\",\"Watch. Learn. Fix. Download our Mobile App!\"],\"testimonials\":[\"We had a sewer backup emergency and your tech, Orlando came that night and was able to get the plumbing back in order that night. And Bob who helped...\",\"John, the tech did a great job of identifying the issue and gave me tips on regular maintenance of the septic tank to prevent the problem. Of special...\",\"Hasan from Roto-Rooter did an excellent job on our drain cleaning. Our garage floor was full of water, and he fixed it. We would not hesitate to call...\",\"We were in an emergency situation with no flushing toilets or water due to a broken and clogged pipe running to our septic system...The technician...\",\"I had a major water leak close to the main water shutoff. Not only did I find an emergency plumber, but he was onsite and had the leak fixed within...\"],\"uniqueSellingPropositions\":[]},\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-13T06:46:24.643Z\"}]"}
