,\"question\":\"Do you serve drinks other than beer?\"},{\"answer\":\"Vista has grown to be a known Hill Country music venue with top talent from Central Texas and beyond. We typically have live music Fridays and Sundays. Please see our event calendar for the latest schedule.\",\"question\":\"When do you have live music?\"},{\"answer\":\"Sorry, nope. Vista is a brewpub with a delicious food menu! We do allow outside celebration desserts with a $25 Dessert Fee, which includes plates, forks and napkins if needed.\",\"question\":\"Can I bring my own food?\"},{\"answer\":\"Yes! We offer guest WIFI.\",\"question\":\"Do you have WIFI?\"},{\"answer\":\"Parking at the Vista Ranch is ample & free! During busy times, please follow the signage to the back pasture when the front lot is full. It’s a short & beautiful walk to the buildings!\",\"question\":\"How about parking?\"},{\"answer\":\"Vista often hosts fun events such as music festivals, educational & community events, movies, and more! The best way to stay in the know if to sign up for our email list and follow us on social media. Check out the Event Calendar on our website.\",\"question\":\"How can I find out about events & happenings?\"}],\"mediaCovers\":[],\"messagingHeadlines\":[\"Visit Us\"],\"testimonials\":[],\"uniqueSellingPropositions\":[\"growing with integrity: low till, water conscious and focused on soil health\"]},\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-13T06:56:57.977Z\"}]"}
