l Country.\",\"pitch\":\"Visit Vista Brewing in Driftwood, TX, a 21-acre destination with chef-driven food, award-winning craft beer, live music, and event spaces near Austin in the Texas Hill Country.\"},\"provenance\":{\"brandingAndStyle.artStyle\":\"derived\",\"brandingAndStyle.writingStyle\":\"derived\",\"foundation.businessModel\":\"derived\",\"foundation.companyRole\":\"derived\",\"foundation.industry\":\"derived\",\"marketAndCustomers.channels\":\"derived\",\"marketAndCustomers.customerNeeds\":\"mock-ai\",\"marketAndCustomers.funnels\":\"derived\",\"marketAndCustomers.idealPersona\":\"mock-ai\",\"marketAndCustomers.industryGroupings\":\"derived\",\"marketAndCustomers.targetBuyers\":\"derived\"},\"scrapedAt\":\"2026-10-13T06:56:57.977Z\",\"sourceUrl\":\"vistabrewingtx.com\",\"thinkBigger\":{\"certifications\":[],\"contentThemes\":[\"abv\",\"texas\",\"barrel aged\",\"beer\",\"hill country\",\"pour\",\"cans\",\"live music\"],\"faqs\":[{\"answer\":\"Yes! We welcome friendly dogs on leashes, and dogs are welcome inside the main Tasting Room & Restaurant.\",\"question\":\"Is Vista dog-friendly?\"},{\"answer\":\"Yes! Vista was built with families in mind. We have 21 acres of land to explore, including forts and lots of open space. There is a treehouse-style playscape, plus kid’s food & drink menus. There is a baby changing table in both the men’s and women’s restrooms.\",\"question\":\"Is Vista family-friendly?\"},{\"answer\":\"For groups of 15 or less seating is first come, first served. We do take bookings for large groups, and can host private parties up to hundreds of guests with our full-service private event department. Get in touch with our event managers via the web form.\",\"question\":\"Do I need to make a reservation?\"},{\"answer\":\"Yes! In addition to all Vista beer here at the brewery, we serve a curated list of Texas wines, many of whom we work with in our beer barrel aging program! We serve Texas cider and wine-based cocktails as well as non-alcoholic drinks.\",\"question\":\"Do you serve drinks other than beer?\"},{\"answer\":\"Vista has grown to be a known Hill Country music venue with top talent from Central Texas and beyond. We typically have live music Fridays and Sundays. Please see our event calendar for the latest schedule.\",\"question\":\"When do you have live music?\"},{\"answer\":\"Sorry, nope. Vista is a brewpub with a delicious food menu! We do allow outside celebration desserts with a $25 Dessert Fee, which includes plates, forks and napkins if needed.\",\"question\":\"Can I bring my own food?\"},{\"answer\":\"Yes! We offer guest WIFI.\",\"question\":\"Do you have WIFI?\"},{\"answer\":\"Parking at the Vista Ranch is ample & free! During busy times, please follow the signage to the back pasture when the front lot is full. It’s a short & beautiful walk to the buildings!\",\"question\":\"How about parking?\"},{\"answer\":\"Vista often hosts fun events such as music festivals, educational & community events, movies, and more! The best way to stay in the know if to sign up for our email list and follow us on social media. Check out the Event Calendar on our website.\",\"question\":\"How can I find out about events & happenings?\"}],\"mediaCovers\":[],\"messagingHeadlines\":[\"Visit Us\"],\"testimonials\":[],\"uniqueSellingPropositions\":[\"growing with integrity: low till, water conscious and focused on soil health\"]},\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-13T06:56:57.977Z\"},{\"brandingAndStyle\":{\"artStyle\":\"Bold, saturated cool-toned palette, clean sans-serif typography (Albert Sans), photo-heavy layouts.\",\"colors\":[\"#FFFFFF\",\"#2663EB\",\"#1F9D55\",\"#D3D8E3\",\"#6E97F2\",\"#6BEDB9\"],\"fonts\":[\"Albert Sans\",\"Figtree\",\"Geist\",\"Inter Tight\"],\"logos\":[\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/1jeR9lQLMKCw6d2Xmjx1jvreBo.png\",\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/RuSy7w9YwJBNXjuus4nPqwTZWA.png\",\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/XOTCzQnHJWRW7LOZGkzh6oSrieo.png\",\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/EPtVjpTyqpqDAWSlYsFsnOn4.png\"],\"writingStyle\":\"Clear, medium-length sentences; speaks directly to the reader (“you”); asks the reader questions. Avg 17 words per sentence.\"},\"companyName\":\"MoFlo\",\"confidenceScore\":0.73,\"foundation\":{\"alternativeNames\":[\"MoFlo, Inc.\"],\"businessModel\":\"SaaS / Subscription\",\"businessModelConfidence\":0.79,\"companyRole\":\"Software vendor\",\"industry\":\"Marketing & Advertising\",\"industryConfidence\":0.58,\"mainAddress\":\"Las Vegas, NV\",\"otherLocations\":[\"8020 W Sahara Ave Unit 240, Las Vegas, NV 89117\"],\"overview\":\"MoFlo automates social posts, blogs, emails & SEO for local businesses — all in one done-for-you platform. Start growing in minutes. Try MoFlo free today.\",\"serviceLocations\":[\"Expansion Build\"],\"website\":\"https://moflo.ai/\"},\"id\":\"kb_1791874621037_9m45asc83\",\"keyPeople\":[],\"marketAndCustomers\":{\"channels\":[\"Website\",\"Phone\",\"Email\",\"Linkedin\",\"X / Twitter\",\"Instagram\",\"Facebook\",\"Youtube\",\"Tiktok\"],\"ctas\":[\"Start for free\",\"Get a demo\",\"Contact\",\"Book a Demo\"],\"customerNeeds\":[\"Dependable help with ai solutions for\",\"Dependable help with trades and services\",\"A provider who reliably serves Expansion Build\",\"Confidence they're hiring a qualified, trustworthy business\"],\"funnels\":[\"Quote request\",\"Booking / appointment\",\"Free trial / signup\",\"Demo request\",\"Phone call\"],\"idealPersona\":\"Small Businesses in Expansion Build who need ai solutions for and trades and services and choose MoFlo for a trusted, marketing & advertising specialist they can rely on.\",\"industryGroupings\":[\"Marketing & Advertising\",\"Home Services\",\"Software & SaaS\"],\"suppliers\":[],\"targetBuyers\":[\"Small Businesses\",\"Local Businesses\",\"Builders\",\"Homeowners\"]},\"offerings\":[{\"category\":\"Service\",\"name\":\"AI Solutions for\"},{\"category\":\"Service\",\"name\":\"Trades and Services\"},{\"category\":\"Service\",\"name\":\"Check Out Our New Case Studies\"},{\"category\":\"Service\",\"name\":\"300%\"},{\"category\":\"Service\",\"name\":\"85%\"},{\"category\":\"Service\",\"name\":\"10 Minutes\"}],\"onlinePresence\":{\"facebook\":\"https://www.facebook.com/people/MoFlo/61578564326471/\",\"instagram\":\"https://www.instagram.com/mofloai/\",\"linkedin\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/mofloai/\",\"other\":{\"email\":\"info@moflo.ai\",\"phone\":\"(702) 350-1757\"},\"tiktok\":\"https://www.tiktok.com/@mofloai\",\"twitter\":\"https://x.com/MoFloAI\",\"youtube\":\"https://www.youtube.com/@MoFloAI\"},\"pagesScraped\":[\"https://moflo.ai/\",\"https://moflo.ai/about\",\"https://moflo.ai/industries/trades-services\",\"https://moflo.ai/contact\",\"https://moflo.ai/help/faqs\",\"https://moflo.ai/moreviews\"],\"positioning\":{\"pitch\":\"MoFlo automates social posts, blogs, emails & SEO for local businesses — all in one done-for-you platform. Start growing in minutes. Try MoFlo free today.\"},\"provenance\":{\"brandingAndStyle.artStyle\":\"derived\",\"brandingAndStyle.writingStyle\":\"derived\",\"foundation.businessModel\":\"derived\",\"foundation.companyRole\":\"derived\",\"foundation.industry\":\"derived\",\"marketAndCustomers.channels\":\"derived\",\"marketAndCustomers.customerNeeds\":\"mock-ai\",\"marketAndCustomers.funnels\":\"derived\",\"marketAndCustomers.idealPersona\":\"mock-ai\",\"marketAndCustomers.industryGroupings\":\"derived\"},\"scrapedAt\":\"2026-10-13T06:57:01.037Z\",\"sourceUrl\":\"moflo.ai\",\"thinkBigger\":{\"certifications\":[\"Each day was a mix of heads-down focus on building MoFlo’s future and team experiences that bonded us far beyond a normal internship.\"],\"communityValues\":\"to level the playing field by providing accessible, affordable, and effective AI-powered solutions that help small and medium-sized businesses.\",\"contentThemes\":[\"las vegas\",\"marketing\",\"case study\",\"demo\",\"questions\",\"growth platform\",\"brand\",\"social\"],\"faqs\":[{\"answer\":\"MoFlo is an AI growth platform that creates and manages your marketing for you — social posts, email campaigns, blog articles, and review responses — through four apps: MoSocial, MoMail, MoBlogs, and MoReviews. Flo, MoFlo's AI, learns your business and generates content that's ready to review and publish, so marketing takes minutes a day instead of hours.\",\"question\":\"What exactly does MoFlo do for my business?\"},{\"answer\":\"No — MoFlo is built for business owners and small teams in industries like real estate, insurance, trades, and franchises who don't have time to run marketing. Content arrives already drafted; your job is to judge whether it sounds like you, not to write it.\",\"question\":\"Do I need to be a marketer to use MoFlo?\"},{\"answer\":\"Individual apps start at $79/mo, and the Business Bundle gives you every app on the platform for $299/mo — roughly the price of two apps. Every plan starts with a 7-day free trial, no long-term contract, cancel anytime.\",\"question\":\"How much does MoFlo cost?\"},{\"answer\":\"Generic AI tools give you a blank prompt box; schedulers just queue what you wrote. MoFlo combines both and adds the missing piece: FloGen proactively generates on-brand content from your business knowledge, and Brand Power scores every piece 0–100 so you know it's on-brand before it goes out. You approve, MoFlo publishes directly to your connected accounts.\",\"question\":\"How is MoFlo different from tools like ChatGPT or a scheduling app?\"},{\"answer\":\"MoSocial publishes to Facebook, Instagram, X, LinkedIn, YouTube, and TikTok; MoMail connects to Mailchimp, Constant Contact, HubSpot, and Follow Up Boss; MoBlogs publishes straight to WordPress; and Google Drive imports your existing files into your Library. Most integrations take under 30 seconds to connect.\",\"question\":\"Which platforms does MoFlo connect to?\"},{\"answer\":\"Minutes. You sign up, tell Flo about your business, connect your accounts, and FloGen starts preparing content immediately — many users have their first posts ready the same day.\",\"question\":\"How long does it take to get started?\"},{\"answer\":\"MoFlo brings social posts, emails, blog content, and review replies into a shared marketing workflow. Its homepage describes apps that turn a marketing channel into work you can review. You can also connect content and files in one place, then manage the handoffs between tools.\",\"question\":\"What marketing work can MoFlo help me create?\"},{\"answer\":\"MoSocial plans, writes, designs, and schedules social posts. The MoFlo homepage describes content arriving ready for review, rather than requiring you to start each post from scratch. You can review posts alongside blogs, emails, and replies in the same place before deciding what represents your business.\",\"question\":\"Do I have to write every social post myself?\"},{\"answer\":\"MoFlo connects social content, emails, blogs, and files in one place. Its Library stores content Flo creates as well as files you upload. That gives you a shared collection of brand material to reuse across marketing work, including images, documents, blog articles, and email drafts.\",\"question\":\"Can MoFlo keep my marketing content together?\"},{\"answer\":\"MoFlo builds AI tools for small and medium sized businesses that want practical technology without enterprise complexity. Its About page describes making AI accessible to business owners without requiring technical expertise. The company focuses on helping those businesses spend less time figuring out tools and more time working on growth.\",\"question\":\"Who is MoFlo built for?\"}],\"mediaCovers\":[],\"messagingHeadlines\":[\"Be #1 on for pest control in Las Vegas, NV\",\"Brand Power gives your brand a score.\",\"Your marketing stack, connected to MoFlo\",\"She creates your content while you run your business.\",\"Pick the Product . See what gets created.\",\"Check Out Our New Case Studies\"],\"testimonials\":[],\"uniqueSellingPropositions\":[\"building MoFlo’s future and team experiences that bonded us far beyond a normal internship\",\"helping those businesses spend less time figuring out tools and more time working on growth\",\"growing their companies instead of spending their time learning complicated systems\",\"a specific need or combine tools into a broader growth system\",\"Respond faster to reviews AI-drafted replies help you stay responsive without the daily manual workload Build customer trust Consistent, professional responses improve your online reputation over time\"]},\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-13T06:57:01.037Z\"}]"}
