12) 515-3004\"}},\"pagesScraped\":[\"https://www.beecavedrilling.com/\",\"https://www.beecavedrilling.com/companyinfo/\",\"https://www.beecavedrilling.com/request-service/\",\"https://www.beecavedrilling.com/contact/\",\"https://www.beecavedrilling.com/staffbios/\",\"https://www.beecavedrilling.com/testimonials/\"],\"positioning\":{\"foundingStory\":\"In July of 1980, Bee Cave Drilling (then known as R&L Pump Service) began in the back room of Rex and Lois Bible’s house in Bee Cave, Texas. Rex grew up in a family of water well drillers and trained under Buster Enochs. By 1986, Rex had saved up enough money to finance a drilling rig and changed the name of the company to Bee Cave Drilling to reflect his expanded services. The company remained a “mom and pop operation” with Rex in the field and Lois in the office with an occasional summer employee until 1993 when Jim Blair joined the staff full-time.\",\"pitch\":\"Service Austin & The Texas Hill Country in water well installation, inspection, & maintenance.\"},\"provenance\":{\"brandingAndStyle.artStyle\":\"derived\",\"brandingAndStyle.writingStyle\":\"derived\",\"foundation.businessModel\":\"derived\",\"foundation.companyRole\":\"derived\",\"foundation.industry\":\"derived\",\"marketAndCustomers.channels\":\"derived\",\"marketAndCustomers.customerNeeds\":\"mock-ai\",\"marketAndCustomers.funnels\":\"derived\",\"marketAndCustomers.idealPersona\":\"mock-ai\",\"marketAndCustomers.industryGroupings\":\"derived\"},\"scrapedAt\":\"2026-10-13T06:56:54.746Z\",\"sourceUrl\":\"beecavedrilling.com\",\"thinkBigger\":{\"certifications\":[\"The owner goes to great lengths to insure the customers satisfaction and it shows through the employees commitment to services excellence.\",\"It’s rare in today’s world to find so many people so fixed on customers satisfaction.\"],\"contentThemes\":[\"water well\",\"texas hill\",\"hill country\",\"well drilling\",\"dripping springs\",\"water wells\",\"wells repair\",\"proudly serving\"],\"faqs\":[],\"mediaCovers\":[],\"messagingHeadlines\":[\"High Quality Water Wells & Repair For The Texas Hill Country\",\"Our Well Services\",\"Why Bee Cave Drilling?\"],\"testimonials\":[\"Thank you for expediting the replacement of our well pump. We sincerely appreciate your efforts and are extremely grateful we have water once again. It’s comforting knowing your team continues to provide quality work at a fair price. Michael M.\"],\"uniqueSellingPropositions\":[\"precision water drilling, utilizing state-of-the-art technology and years of experience to access pristine underground water sources\",\"designing, drilling, and maintaining public supply wells that meet rigorous health and environmental standards\",\"taking care of our customers\",\"their field and take great pride in their work\"]},\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-13T06:56:54.746Z\"},{\"brandingAndStyle\":{\"artStyle\":\"Classic serif typography (Merriweather), moderate use of photography.\",\"colors\":[],\"fonts\":[\"Merriweather\",\"Alatsi\"],\"logos\":[\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/624b27dc7e25e41666b0caa5/b363db7f-e694-4eb5-811a-afac95cba244/VistaWeb_Logo.png?format=1500w\",\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/624b27dc7e25e41666b0caa5/9fe73518-edc9-42a8-9785-3d799a6802eb/VistaLogo_Rough.png\",\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/624b27dc7e25e41666b0caa5/beeeb7d0-f90e-43b0-986e-c161ab35e0ea/favicon.ico?format=100w\"],\"writingStyle\":\"Long, detailed sentences; personal first-person voice (“we”); energetic, uses exclamation points; asks the reader questions. Avg 21 words per sentence.\"},\"companyName\":\"Vista Brewing\",\"confidenceScore\":0.59,\"foundation\":{\"alternativeNames\":[],\"businessModel\":\"Hospitality & Venue\",\"businessModelConfidence\":0.93,\"companyRole\":\"Hospitality operator\",\"industry\":\"Food & Beverage\",\"industryConfidence\":0.7,\"mainAddress\":\"13551 Ranch to Market Road 150 Driftwood, TX, 78619 United States\",\"otherLocations\":[],\"overview\"