 515-3004\"}},\"pagesScraped\":[\"https://www.beecavedrilling.com/\",\"https://www.beecavedrilling.com/companyinfo/\",\"https://www.beecavedrilling.com/request-service/\",\"https://www.beecavedrilling.com/contact/\",\"https://www.beecavedrilling.com/staffbios/\",\"https://www.beecavedrilling.com/testimonials/\"],\"positioning\":{\"foundingStory\":\"In July of 1980, Bee Cave Drilling (then known as R&L Pump Service) began in the back room of Rex and Lois Bible’s house in Bee Cave, Texas. Rex grew up in a family of water well drillers and trained under Buster Enochs. By 1986, Rex had saved up enough money to finance a drilling rig and changed the name of the company to Bee Cave Drilling to reflect his expanded services. The company remained a “mom and pop operation” with Rex in the field and Lois in the office with an occasional summer employee until 1993 when Jim Blair joined the staff full-time.\",\"pitch\":\"Service Austin & The Texas Hill Country in water well installation, inspection, & maintenance.\"},\"provenance\":{\"brandingAndStyle.artStyle\":\"derived\",\"brandingAndStyle.writingStyle\":\"derived\",\"foundation.businessModel\":\"derived\",\"foundation.companyRole\":\"derived\",\"foundation.industry\":\"derived\",\"marketAndCustomers.channels\":\"derived\",\"marketAndCustomers.customerNeeds\":\"mock-ai\",\"marketAndCustomers.funnels\":\"derived\",\"marketAndCustomers.idealPersona\":\"mock-ai\",\"marketAndCustomers.industryGroupings\":\"derived\"},\"scrapedAt\":\"2026-10-13T06:58:07.173Z\",\"sourceUrl\":\"beecavedrilling.com\",\"thinkBigger\":{\"certifications\":[\"The owner goes to great lengths to insure the customers satisfaction and it shows through the employees commitment to services excellence.\",\"It’s rare in today’s world to find so many people so fixed on customers satisfaction.\"],\"contentThemes\":[\"water well\",\"texas hill\",\"hill country\",\"well drilling\",\"dripping springs\",\"water wells\",\"wells repair\",\"proudly serving\"],\"faqs\":[