rooter, you get more than a guarantee.\"],\"contentThemes\":[\"drain cleaning\",\"job done\",\"done right\",\"special financing\",\"highly trained\",\"trained professionals\",\"professionals since\",\"original experts\"],\"faqs\":[{\"answer\":\"We recommend an enzyme-type product, such as Roto-Rooter Pipe Shield®. The natural enzymes eat the grease and hair and keep the pipe from filling with sludge. Pipe Shield's exclusive formula uses natural bacteria to breakdown deposits, so it's safe for the environment. When used as directed each month, build-up can be prevented for up to 30 days.\",\"question\":\"What drain cleaning product could I use to get my drains flowing better?\"},{\"answer\":\"We recommend hiring a professional to apply RootX. However, you can do it yourself, but please read the instructions carefully before using. Flushing drain cleaning products down the toilet can cause additional problems if not done carefully. This product works best when applied through a sewer clean-out port with the water running.\",\"question\":\"Is RootX® something I can flush down my toilet or is that something Roto-Rooter or a professional should handle?\"}],\"mediaCovers\":[],\"messagingHeadlines\":[\"The Plumbing Experts You've Trusted for Over 90 Years\",\"LEAVE PLUMBING TO THE PROS\",\"YOU HAVE QUESTIONS, WE HAVE ANSWERS.\",\"Watch. Learn. Fix. Download our Mobile App!\"],\"testimonials\":[\"We had a sewer backup emergency and your tech, Orlando came that night and was able to get the plumbing back in order that night. And Bob who helped...\",\"John, the tech did a great job of identifying the issue and gave me tips on regular maintenance of the septic tank to prevent the problem. Of special...\",\"Hasan from Roto-Rooter did an excellent job on our drain cleaning. Our garage floor was full of water, and he fixed it. We would not hesitate to call...\",\"We were in an emergency situation with no flushing toilets or water due to a broken and clogged pipe running to our septic system...The technician...\",\"I had a major water leak close to the main water shutoff. Not only did I find an emergency plumber, but he was onsite and had the leak fixed within...\"],\"uniqueSellingPropositions\":[]},\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-13T07:00:26.797Z\"}]"}
